      "type": "text",
      "text": "Correct calcium and phosphate deficiencies. Uncomp rickets (adequate Ca and phosphate intake): vit D3 40 mcg (1600 IU) orally once a day; after about 1 mo, reduce to the usual maintenance of 15 mcg (600 IU) once/day. Tetany: add IV calcium salts for up to 1 wk."
